// template: After Hours
// order: 3
// Deep, hypnotic melodic techno: a rolling 1/16 bass that is its
// own melody, wide detuned chords with an unconventional voicing, shuffled drums, a dark
// vocal motif in call-and-response. Every melody is original.
title "After Hours"
tempo 122
key c minor
kick:    kick     dark     x... x... x... x...                                   | decay 0.5 | gain 0.88
sub:     sub      warm     c1 ~ ~ ~ / ab0 ~ ~ ~ / eb1 ~ ~ ~ / g0 ~ ~ ~             | duck 0.85 | gain 0.85
bass:    bass     round    . c2 c2 eb2 . c2 c2 g1 . c2 c2 eb2 . g2 c2 bb1 / . ab1 ab1 c2 . ab1 ab1 eb2 . ab1 ab1 c2 . eb2 ab1 g1 / . eb2 eb2 g2 . eb2 eb2 bb1 . eb2 eb2 g2 . bb2 eb2 d2 / . g1 g1 bb1 . g1 g1 d2 . g1 g1 bb1 . d2 g1 f2   | duck 0.85 | cutoff sine(16) 400..1500 | gain 0.72
clap:    clap     roomy    .... x... .... x...                                   | reverb small | gain 1.16
roll:    clap     snap     .... .... .... .... / .... .... .... .... / .... .... .... .... / .... .... .... .... / .... .... .... .... / .... .... .... .... / x.x. x.x. x.x. x.x. / xxxx xxxx xxxx xxxx   | gain saw(8) 0.15..0.45 | reverb small | pan 0.1
hat:     hat      dusty    . x x?0.5 x . x x?0.6 x . x x?0.5 x . x x?0.7 x     | swing 0.16 | pan -0.15 | gain 0.4
ohat:    hat      metal    ..x. ..x. ..x. ..x?0.6x                               | swing 0.16 | pan 0.2 | gain 1.13
shaker:  shaker   bright   x x?0.6 x x?0.7 x x?0.6 x x?0.7 x x?0.6 x x?0.7 x x?0.6 x x?0.8   | swing 0.16 | pan 0.3 | gain 0.51
rim:     rim      wood     .... ..x. .... .x.. / .... ..x. .... x.x?0.4.         | swing 0.14 | delay 1/8 | pan -0.3 | reverb small | gain 0.5
perc:    perc     ping     .... .... ..x. .... / .... .x.. .... ..x.             | delay 3/16 | reverb wide | pan 0.35 | gain 0.4
chord:   pad      hypnotic   Cm9 ~ ~ ~ / Abmaj9 ~ ~ ~ / Ebadd9 ~ ~ ~ / Gm7 ~ ~ ~   | voicing spread | detune 0.6 | attack 0.6 | release 2.4 | brightness sine(16) 0.3..0.65 | duck 0.7 | reverb plate | gain 0.23
stab:    stab     short    . . Cm9 . . . . . / . . Abmaj7 . . . . . / . . Ebadd9 . . . . . / . . Gm7 . . Gm7 . .   | lowpass 1600 | delay 3/16 | duck 0.5 | reverb wide | gain 0.45
keys:    epiano   bell     . . . . c4 ~ . . / . . eb4 . . . . . / . . . . bb3 ~ . . / . . d4 . . g4 . .   | chorus 0.3 | delay 1/4 | reverb wide | pan 0.25 | gain 0.5
voice:   vox      ooh      c4 ~ ~ . . . eb4 ~ / . . . . . . . . / g3 ~ ~ . . . bb3 ~ / . . . . d4 ~ . .   | legato | glide 0.06 | vowel sine(8) 0.2..0.7 | delay 1/4 | reverb sea | gain 0.54
answer:  vox      talk     . . . . . . . . / . . eb4 . c4 . . . / . . . . . . . . / . . g4 . f4 . . .   | vowel sine(4) 0.1..0.8 | delay 3/16 | reverb wide | pan -0.3 | gain 0.4
pad:     strings  slow     Cm ~ ~ ~ / Ab ~ ~ ~ / Eb ~ ~ ~ / Gm ~ ~ ~             | voicing spread | reverb sea | gain 0.37
rise:    sweep    up       x~~~ ~~~~ ~~~~ ~~~~                                   | cutoff saw(8) 300..9000 | gain saw(8) 0.15..0.5
riser:   riser    both     x... / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / ....   | length 15.5 | gain 0.5
down:    downlifter noise  x~~~ ~~~~ ~~~~ ~~~~ / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / ....   | reverb wide | gain 0.6
impact:  impact   hit      x... / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / ....   | reverb sea | gain 0.75
section intro   kick hat shaker rim chord
section groove  kick sub bass clap hat ohat shaker rim perc chord | loop
section verse   kick sub bass clap hat ohat shaker rim perc chord stab voice
section build   kick clap roll hat shaker rim perc chord stab keys rise riser
section drop    kick sub bass clap hat ohat shaker rim perc chord stab keys voice answer impact
section break   chord pad keys voice down
section groove2 kick sub bass clap hat ohat shaker rim perc chord stab keys
section drop2   kick sub bass clap hat ohat shaker rim perc chord stab keys voice answer pad impact
section outro   kick hat shaker rim chord
song intro 16, groove 32, verse 16, build 8, drop 32, break 16, groove2 16, drop2 32, outro 16
